piper_phonemize (wasm build of espeak-ng based phonemizer): @diffusionstudio/piper-wasm 1.0.0 – MIT; ESM loader from @mintplex-labs/piper-tts-web 1.0.5 – MIT.
espeak-ng data (bundled in piper_phonemize.data) – GPL-3.0, https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng
Voice models are downloaded on demand from https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices (each model has its own license, see its MODEL_CARD).
